{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106873","id":2546895580,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Xzorc","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106873","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106873.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106873.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106873","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106873/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106873/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106873/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2085f50697711912ad52a5c3ecfe2e031d162c7d","number":106873,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Warn when classes are registered out of order","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The main initialization process is a mess.\r\n\r\nType registration is interspersed with registering singletons, servers, constants, and settings.\r\nOne of the reasons is that the code is defensively coded: If something isn't as expected, we try to make it right automatically.\r\n\r\nI propose to make a first step towards sanitization, by warning when classes are registered out of order. This should enforce making intentional decisions about classes:\r\n- Should they even be registered? (or use `GDSOFTCLASS` instead)\r\n- If yes, during which phase should they be registered?\r\n- Should they be exposed or registered as internal?\r\n\r\nThis PR does not make any decisions yet. Instead, it uses a conservative approach, and only prints during dev builds, giving us a window to sanitize our registration order. The check is further disabled for unit test builds because some unit tests monitor output, causing tests to fail on incorrect initialization order.\r\nIn the future, the scope of these warnings should be escalated to `DEBUG_ENABLED`. \r\n\r\n_Note: There are a hundred warnings or so currently when starting the editor with `DEV_ENABLED`._","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":47